TITLE:: FxPalette
summary:: the colours and fonts every effect window is drawn in
categories:: Libraries>ParaEQ
related:: Classes/ParaEQGUI, Classes/CompressorGUI, Classes/ModulePalette

DESCRIPTION::
The same values the module family, Insight and ServerView use, so an eq opened
from a pad, from the master chain or from an Ndef looks like one instrument.

code::
FxPalette.bg;
FxPalette.eqBand(2);
FxPalette.label("freq", 30);
FxPalette.button("flat", 40, { "flat".postln });
::

CLASSMETHODS::

