METHOD:: peak
The colours.

METHOD:: eqBands
METHOD:: eqBand
One colour per eq band, left to right, so the colour says which end of the
spectrum a handle belongs to.

METHOD:: font
METHOD:: smallFont
METHOD:: boldFont
METHOD:: monoFont

METHOD:: label
A small dim link::Classes/StaticText::.

METHOD:: button
A one state link::Classes/Button:: in the house colours.

METHOD:: darken
Give a window the dark palette, so the Qt widgets that are not coloured by hand
come out like the rest.
